Planted mutant: OMNISCIENCE. Restores the observer leak that ADR-0022
(Proposed) closed: a perspective with no delta reads the ground trope's
live value instead of the prior frozen at registration.

This is deliberately NOT a Cargo feature. Features unify across
`--all-features` and across dependents, so a feature-gated mutant could be
switched on in a real build. This patch is only ever applied, by
scripts/check-observer-mutant.sh, to a throwaway copy of the workspace, and
the observer tests in crates/enaction-trace/tests/observer.rs must FAIL
there. If they pass against this patch, they no longer guard the boundary.

Everything above the `diff --git` line is ignored by patch(1).

diff --git a/crates/enaction-trace/src/store.rs b/crates/enaction-trace/src/store.rs
--- a/crates/enaction-trace/src/store.rs
+++ b/crates/enaction-trace/src/store.rs
@@ -406,7 +406,7 @@ pub fn belief(
                     // never observed it (the Sally-Anne probe in
                     // tests/observer.rs; the planted mutant restores exactly
                     // this read).
-                    prior.value_milli
+                    trace.latest_value(prior.trope)?
                 };
                 Some(BeliefView {
                     value_milli,
